# Source of truth for the light_all umbrella CI job's Python deps
# (Serverless env v5 / classic DBR 17–18, full feature set).
# Consumed by CI via: pip install --require-hashes -r python/geobrix/requirements-light-all-ci.txt
#
# Regenerate (from python/geobrix/):
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 \
#       --output-file requirements-light-all-ci.txt requirements-light-all-ci.in
#
# This .in uses a local-package-with-extra reference so uv expands [light_all]
# directly from pyproject.toml. The [light_all] extra pulls [light]+[stac]+[vizx]+[overture].
# [light] caps mapbox-vector-tile<2.2 (protobuf 5.x; Serverless env v5 / classic DBR <=18).
# [light_dbr19_all] is the DBR-19 twin: see requirements-light-dbr19-all-ci.in.
#
# Note: CI resolves without Serverless grpcio-status constraints; the protobuf version
# in this lock (5.x) reflects the [light] cap on mapbox-vector-tile, NOT a CI grpcio
# constraint. The real runtime protobuf is set at cluster install time.

# Local package — expands geobrix[light_all] from pyproject.toml
.[light_all]
